export anchor SignalBoardStyle:
    number: 343
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Signal board
    idea: The pipeline as a black departures board, one terse uppercase row per deal on split flap tiles, each led by a signal lamp whose shape and word give its state, with the key figures spelled out tile by tile above.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #050607, the page, cell gaps and the style sheet
        board: #0c0e10, board frames
        tile: #16191c, the lower half of every flap tile and row
        tileTop: #1d2125, the upper half of every flap tile
        seam: #000000, the split line across each tile
        line: #2a2f35, board frames and the secondary border
        amber: #ffd23f, figures, values, the header bar, primary button and focus
        onAmber: #1a1400, text on the header bar
        ink: #f2f2ea, deal names and Open lamps
        muted: #a5abb3, column heads, stage and owner
        green: #6ff09a, the Final call play lamp and Landed check lamp
        sky: #7fd0ff, the Booked diamond lamp
        red: #ff7a66, the Stalled triangle lamp and row underline
    type:
        One mono stack, ui-monospace, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas, all caps
        with wide tracking. Base 15px. Figure tiles 22px at 800, the header
        20px at 800 tracked .18em, rows 15px at 800 tracked .08em, column
        heads 11px at 600 tracked .2em, legend 12px.
    layout:
        An amber header bar holds Brightwork Sales, Pipeline Q4 and a dark
        Add deal button. Under it a board strip spells Pipeline, Won Q4,
        Target, Win rate and Open deals one character per flap tile in
        amber, with commas narrow and tile free. The main board, Deals 7 on
        board, is a table with columns Signal, Deal, Stage, Value, Owner
        and Remark. Every cell is a flap tile with a black seam across its
        middle and 2px black gaps between cells. Signals read Open with a
        hollow circle for the two leads, Booked with a diamond for
        Northpass, Sent with a square for Kettle and Co, Stalled with a
        triangle and a red underline for Saltwater Freight, Final call with
        a play shape for Fernhill Studio and Landed with a check for
        Bluewater Clinics. Remarks read Demo 04 Nov, Sent 28 Oct, No reply
        12 days, Closing 07 Nov and Closed 22 Oct. A signal key follows,
        then a Notices board with three rows tagged Call, Opened and Quiet,
        and a Filter board button. On phones each row becomes a block with
        the signal on top, deal and value, stage and owner, then the remark.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 4px between rows, 2px seams between cells, 16px board padding, 24px gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: High and even. Seven deal rows read as one board, every cell one terse value.
    corners: 2px. The board is square.
    borders: 1px frames on boards, 2px black gaps between cells, a 3px red underline on the stalled row.
    shadows: None. The black tile seam gives the flap its depth.
    icons:
        Solid signal lamps lead every row, a hollow circle, diamond,
        square, triangle, play shape or check, each with its word.
    focus: A 3px amber outline offset 2px.
    tone: Departure board shorthand, such as Booked, Final call, Landed, No reply 12 days and Notices.
